               Output: bson_distinct_unwind(collection.document, 'value'::text, 'en-u-ks-level1'::text)
               ->  Custom Scan (DocumentDBApiDistinctQueryScan) (actual rows=2 loops=1)
                     Output: collection.document
                     ->  Index Scan using idx_value_en_s1 on documentdb_data.documents_20200 collection (actual rows=2 loops=1)
                           Output: collection.document
